# Cache for scripts/update_adi_stub_symbols.py - copies of Apple libraries, pulled from
# their CDN so the stub symbol lists can be regenerated. Never committed.
.adi-libs/

# Per-developer Android Studio state: test-panel column widths and the device you happen
# to deploy to. Churns on every run, and records the model name of whatever phone is plugged
# in - none of which belongs to anybody else working on this.
/.idea/androidTestResultsUserPreferences.xml
/.idea/deploymentTargetSelector.xml

# Fixture-investigation notebook. Its whole job is decoding real exports, so its saved cell
# outputs contain the very things the fixtures under app/src/test/resources/ exist to have
# stripped: device names ("<person>'s iPad"), record UUIDs, key material. Committing it would
# publish, in a notebook, exactly what was redacted out of the plists next to it.
scripts/plist_explorer.ipynb
